{"html":"<div><div>\n\n</div><p>\nThe OneLaser tool bag includes essential accessories and maintenance tools required for machine setup, operation, and routine care. This page provides a complete overview of all included parts, their functions, and special notes to help users quickly identify and properly use each item.\n</p><div>\n\n</div><h2 id=\"machine-accessories-list\"> Machine Accessories List</h2><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td><strong>No.</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Physical Photos</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Application / Description</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Notes</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/1_tool-bag_internet_cable.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"Ethernet internet cable included in OneLaser tool bag\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Internet Cable</td>\n        <td>Connecting the software and machine</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>2</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/2_tool-bag_pc_cable.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"PC connection cable for OneLaser machine\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>PC Cable</td>\n        <td>Connecting the software and machine</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/3_tool-bag_usb_cable.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"USB cable for connecting laser camera\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>USB Cable</td>\n        <td>Connecting the camera</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n   